invariant: INV-46
file: mlkem_vector.c
catches: mlkem_vector_equiv_test
reason: the inverse layer of span 16 gives each block of 32 coefficients
  the twiddle factor of the block beside it, where mlk_poly_invntt reads
  15 - 2*block for the first and 14 - 2*block for the second. The code
  is common to both instruction sets, so the equivalence test on either
  finds the coefficients that differ.

--- old
        twiddle low = twiddle_at(15 - 2 * block);
        twiddle high = twiddle_at(14 - 2 * block);
--- new
        twiddle low = twiddle_at(14 - 2 * block);
        twiddle high = twiddle_at(15 - 2 * block);
